+<a id="consolidated-03"></a>
+3. **FAA administrative decision and follow-through.** Seek signed consideration/action/no-action and reasons, supporting documents, dated notice, investigation follow-up/resolution/closure entries and distribution records. DOT 8000.1C is acquired, including investigation Chapter II, but its effective version, FAA implementation and case routing remain to be joined to this case. The normally-requested 60-day provision is not an unconditional missed-deadline finding.
