+<a id="consolidated-04"></a>
+4. **FAA 2001 recording capability versus handbook account.** The February 2005 WOC meeting summary says WOC lacked line recording on September 11 while an agent questioned a handbook presented as applicable then which described emergency-net recording. Seek the readable effective editions, actual promised verification response, equipment/channel installation and export/overwrite/hold logs. Distinguish WOC, DOT CMC, FAA CMC/EOC, DEN, bridges and priority lines; later witness accounts do not establish 2001 configuration.
