+### 9. Where are the native NEADS recordings and clock records?
+
+**Clue:** A held NEADS MP3 matches size/SHA-1 fields in a public archive catalog. The returned item lists no candidate WAV/database/archive filenames under the tested extensions. Neither observation authenticates a recording master or rules out other collections. [Catalog/fingerprint study](https://github.com/AveLyra/911-conspiracy-investigation/blob/007fea0367ec410acaa2b75d239bfb71c2393158/investigation/broader-evidence/neads-native-release-inventory-2026-10-29/README.md).
