+The V02 [revision checklist](CITATIONS.md#local-f7d8bcbae5200fa3), [text diff](CITATIONS.md#local-f41cfe7fa041de7b) and [verification results](CITATIONS.md#local-5ff676158383ac44) document the current authentication audit. The earlier V01 review links above remain preserved history. Source and static-assembly verification is not a completed numerical replay or historical-cause finding.
