+The V03 [revision checklist](CITATIONS.md#local-118a63f873a78460), [text diff](CITATIONS.md#local-5b591dfb31c57855) and [verification results](CITATIONS.md#local-2c20ae88f15631d7) document the October26 integration of the October25 study. New constraint/source checks are separated from reused completed numerical/annotation work; no accepted engineering model validation or cause inference follows.
